#: ../../tools/intact_tools.rst:66 b8ccc37b772e49d18ba1a512ab9fe31e
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed information about a specific interaction by"
" its IntAct interaction ID. Requires an IntAct interaction ID in format "
"'EBI-XXXXXX-EBI-YYYYYY' (e.g., 'EBI-366083-EBI-366083'). To get "
"interaction IDs: 1) Use intact\\_get\\_interactions with a protein/gene "
"identifier - it returns 'interaction\\_ids' field, or 2) Use "
"intact\\_search\\_interactions - it also returns 'interaction\\_ids' "
"field. Then use one of those IDs with this tool to get detailed "
"interaction information. Returns complete interaction data including "
"participants, interaction type, detection methods, and publications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/intact_tools.rst:70 75fd05565c75444f8c8d4c48a09d6d19
msgid ""
"``interaction_id`` (string) (required) IntAct interaction ID in format "
"'EBI-XXXXXX-EBI-YYYYYY' (e.g., 'EBI-366083-EBI-366083'). Get these IDs "
"from intact\\_get\\_interactions or intact\\_search\\_interactions "
"results (see 'interaction\\_ids' field)"
msgstr ""

